{\b\fs32\cf0 \uc0\u8211 Exemple complet: MainWindow.xaml optimis\'e9\par
}\fs20\cf0 \uc0\u8211 Voici la version compl\'e8tement adaptative:\par
\par
{\fs18\cf2 \uc0\u8220\par
<Window x:Class=\"SuiviPortefolio.Portefeuille.PortefeuilleView.MainWindow\"\par
        xmlns=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation\"\par
        xmlns:x=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml\"\par
        Title=\"Suivi Portefolio\"\par
        WindowState=\"Maximized\"\par
        MinWidth=\"800\" MinHeight=\"600\"\par
        WindowStartupLocation=\"CenterScreen\">\par
\par
    <DockPanel>\par
        <Menu DockPanel.Dock=\"Top\">\par
            <MenuItem Header=\"_Fichier\">\par
                <MenuItem Header=\"Choisir dossier base...\" />\par
                <MenuItem Header=\"_Sauvegarder\" />\par
                <MenuItem Header=\"_Restaurer\" />\par
                <MenuItem Header=\"_Quitter\" />\par
            </MenuItem>\par
        </Menu>\par
\par
        <Grid>\par
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>\par
                <RowDefinition Height=\"Auto\" />\par
                <RowDefinition Height=\"*\" />\par
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>\par
\par
            <Button Grid.Row=\"0\" Content=\"Basculer mode sombre\" HorizontalAlignment=\"Right\" Margin=\"10\" />\par
\par
            <TabControl Grid.Row=\"1\" Margin=\"0\" Padding=\"0\">\par
                <TabItem Header=\"Portefeuille\">\par
                    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility=\"Auto\">\par
                        <Grid Margin=\"10\">\par
                            <Grid.RowDefinitions>\par
                                <RowDefinition Height=\"Auto\" />\par
                                <RowDefinition Height=\"Auto\" />\par
                                <RowDefinition Height=\"*\" />\par
                            </Grid.RowDefinitions>\par
\par
                            <StackPanel Grid.Row=\"0\">\par
                                <TextBlock Text=\"PORTEFEUILLES\" Style=\"{DynamicResource TitleH1Style}\" />\par
                                <ComboBox ItemsSource=\"{Binding ListePortefeuilles}\" SelectedItem=\"{Binding PortefeuilleSelectionne}\" />\par
                            </StackPanel>\par
\par
                            <StackPanel Grid.Row=\"1\">\par
                                <Button Content=\"Ajouter/Modifier portefeuille\" HorizontalAlignment=\"Stretch\" />\par
                                <Button Content=\"Modifier portefeuille\" HorizontalAlignment=\"Stretch\" />\par
                                <Button Content=\"D\'e9finir comme d\'e9faut\" HorizontalAlignment=\"Stretch\" />\par
                            </StackPanel>\par
\par
                            <GroupBox Grid.Row=\"2\" Header=\"Portefeuille s\'e9lectionn\'e9\">\par
                                <StackPanel Margin=\"10\">\par
                                    <TextBlock Text=\"{Binding Portefeuille.PtfNom}\" />\par
                                    <TextBlock Text=\"{Binding Portefeuille.PtfType}\" />\par
                                    <TextBlock Text=\"{Binding Portefeuille.PtfDevise}\" />\par
                                    <TextBlock Text=\"Solde:\" FontWeight=\"Bold\" />\par
                                    <TextBlock Text=\"{Binding Portefeuille.PtfSolde, StringFormat='{}{0:F2}'}\" />\par
                                </StackPanel>\par
                            </GroupBox>\par
                        </Grid>\par
                    </ScrollViewer>\par
                </TabItem>\par
\par
                <TabItem Header=\"Comptes\">\par
                    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility=\"Auto\">\par
                        <compte:CompteView />\par
                    </ScrollViewer>\par
                </TabItem>\par
\par
                <TabItem Header=\"Transactions\">\par
                    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility=\"Auto\">\par
                        <transaction:TransView/>\par
                    </ScrollViewer>\par
                </TabItem>\par
            </TabControl>\par
        </Grid>\par
    </DockPanel>\par
</Window>\par
}\par
\par

{\b\fs32\cf0 \uc0\u8211 Outils pour tester\par
}\fs20\cf0 \uc0\u8211\par
1. \'c9muler un petit \'e9cran sous Windows\par
   - Param\'e8tres > Syst\'e8me > Affichage > S\'e9lectionner 1024\u215768 ou 1280\u215720\par
\par
2. Live Visual Tree (Visual Studio)\par
   - Debug > Windows > Live Visual Tree\par
   - Live Property Explorer pour inspecter les contr\'f4les\par
\par
3. Tester le scaling DPI\par
   - Param\'e8tres > Syst\'e8me > Affichage > Facteur d'\'e9chelle (125%, 150%)\par
\par

{\b\fs32\cf0 \uc0\u8211 Points d'attention\par
}\fs20\cf0 \uc0\u8211\par
1. Images et ic\'f4nes: Utiliser des ic\'f4nes vectorielles (SVG) ou haute r\'e9solution\par
2. Fen\'eatres modales: Appliquer les m\'eames principes (CompteEditWindow.xaml, etc.)\par
3. Performances: D\'e9sactiver animations lourdes, limiter colonnes DataGrid\par
4. Accessibilit\'e9: V\'e9rifier contrastes, permettre zoom, ajouter raccourcis clavier\par
\par

